profile:
  alias: Cinder
  name: Elias Glas
  archetype: Radiant Icon
  streetCred: 0
  notoriety: 0
  description: |2-
        Elias Glas was groomed to be a junior diplomat from a young age, born into the low-tier nobility of Tir Tarngire. He
        "burned-bright" under the mentorship of a fire-bringer mentor. 

        Elias stands just over six feet, possessing the kind of effortless Elven grace that makes everyone else in the room
        feel slightly clumsy. He’s dressed in what runners call "Tactical Sartorialism"—a charcoal-grey armored greatcoat
        that looks suspiciously like high-end Tír fashion, layered over a deep crimson silk tunic. He doesn’t carry a
        visible firearm, and he doesn’t have the twitchy, overclocked energy of a street sam. Instead, he carries a calm,
        centered gravity.
  personality: |-
    Elias has the "radiant" personality required in his past diplomatic life. Aloof, and at times impersonal not many
        crises bother him. Underneath this he deeply cares for those in his close circles and the citizens exploited by the
        big 10. He.. just doesn't always show it in appropriate manners. 
  lifestyle:
    quality: Middle
    monthsPaid: 1
